WEBVTT

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:09.670
Explosive Shoot

00:00:16.490 --> 00:00:19.810
Keep fighting chasing your dream

00:00:19.810 --> 00:00:23.140
with love, courage and friendship

00:00:23.140 --> 00:00:26.640
This Blade and I are one

00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:29.680
Spin as hard as you can until the limit

00:00:29.680 --> 00:00:32.780
BURNING SOUL

00:00:43.710 --> 00:00:46.200
The things I can't do alone

00:00:46.200 --> 00:00:50.140
are not impossible if you're with me

00:00:50.490 --> 00:00:52.960
Come with me

00:00:52.960 --> 00:00:56.280
to the ends of this world

00:00:58.070 --> 00:01:03.540
The Four Sacred Beasts are athletes of love

00:01:04.330 --> 00:01:07.100
Shine! Open your eyes!

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:09.730
Dragoon  Dranzer  Draciel  Driger

00:01:09.730 --> 00:01:12.450
Awaken!

00:01:12.790 --> 00:01:16.060
Fly across the sky, my energy

00:01:16.060 --> 00:01:19.380
Rise up, Sacred Beast!

00:01:19.380 --> 00:01:22.830
To defeat all the enemies who stand in our way

00:01:22.830 --> 00:01:26.050
jump, bearing everyone's hopes

00:01:26.070 --> 00:01:29.080
SHINING SOUL

00:01:30.230 --> 00:01:33.350
You're the BBA Team, right? Then fight me!

00:01:33.350 --> 00:01:34.550
Go... Shoot!

00:01:47.640 --> 00:01:51.920
Rei, do you know this guy? Who the heck is he?

00:01:59.090 --> 00:02:02.440
Let's just say we're somewhat acquainted. Isn't that right, Rei-san?

00:02:08.070 --> 00:02:13.090
A New Sacred Beast - The Byakko Clan

00:02:17.580 --> 00:02:22.280
Rei, you're really siding with <i>these</i> guys? What a fall from grace!

00:02:22.600 --> 00:02:23.830
How dare you?!

00:02:25.260 --> 00:02:28.260
I'm <i>so</i> scared! But I'm right, am I not?

00:02:28.590 --> 00:02:32.790
Your Bey was blown away by a single attack of mine.

00:02:32.790 --> 00:02:36.750
<i>No!</i> Time had passed since Takao's shot his Bey!

00:02:36.750 --> 00:02:41.610
Exactly. Takao's Beyblade is an attack-type made to take down its opponent in one move.

00:02:41.610 --> 00:02:43.450
So its endurance is lacking.

00:02:43.770 --> 00:02:47.010
Amazing teamwork, when it comes to making excuses...

00:02:47.310 --> 00:02:48.210
Stop it.

00:02:49.050 --> 00:02:52.290
Kiki, why are you in a place like this?

00:02:52.290 --> 00:02:55.570
Rey, who the heck is this jerk?

00:03:13.810 --> 00:03:16.170
How could I lose to that guy..?

00:03:17.610 --> 00:03:20.800
I have no use for you anymore. Get out of my sight.

00:03:25.300 --> 00:03:30.430
Tsk! To think I had the chance to join the Byakko Clan...

00:03:32.000 --> 00:03:34.770
That hurt! Where the heck were you watching?!

00:03:35.600 --> 00:03:38.690
Oh... Sorry about that.

00:03:38.690 --> 00:03:40.640
Listen here!

00:03:41.090 --> 00:03:42.200
You are..!

00:03:43.110 --> 00:03:44.710
I'll ask again.

00:03:45.380 --> 00:03:49.960
Why are you here Kiki?
You, a member of the Byakko Clan..!

00:03:50.390 --> 00:03:51.950
Byakko Clan..?

00:03:52.980 --> 00:03:59.010
I came here... to battle with you! Get ready, Rei!

00:03:59.920 --> 00:04:07.210
You want to fight me? Don't bother. My Driger is not weak enough to be defeated by the likes of you.

00:04:07.810 --> 00:04:11.490
Don't think my Garman is the same as in the past!

00:04:11.940 --> 00:04:17.300
I'm sure you have gotten stronger since then, but you know nothing about the outside world.

00:04:17.300 --> 00:04:23.520
Trying to get away from the fight with your words? Did you lose your courage too when you betrayed us, Rei?

00:04:24.330 --> 00:04:25.970
I won't let that slide!

00:04:25.970 --> 00:04:29.520
Very well. If words aren't enough, I'll make you understand with my Bey.

00:04:29.520 --> 00:04:33.120
Wait, Rei! Let me do this!

00:04:33.120 --> 00:04:34.410
Takao..!

00:04:34.710 --> 00:04:39.760
I'll pay you back for earlier! I'm not going to forgive you who made a fool of my Dragoon!

00:04:40.560 --> 00:04:46.780
<i>You</i> will fight in Rei's place? You have already been defeated once and still don't understand... What a fool you are.

00:04:47.590 --> 00:04:50.450
I will show you the <i>true</i> extent of my power!

00:04:51.040 --> 00:04:52.020
Also,

00:04:52.810 --> 00:04:57.030
I can't forgive someone who calls one of my friends a coward!

00:04:57.460 --> 00:04:59.160
That's right.

00:04:59.160 --> 00:05:00.530
That was wonderful, Takao.

00:05:01.030 --> 00:05:02.000
Takao...

00:05:03.280 --> 00:05:05.760
This 'friendship' farce is disgusting.

00:05:05.760 --> 00:05:08.720
Very well. You'll fall prey to my Garman.

00:05:08.990 --> 00:05:12.030
Underestimate me and you
will be in for a rude awakening!

00:05:14.620 --> 00:05:18.130
Y-You are... Gaou-sama..?

00:05:20.000 --> 00:05:22.330
I remember you... You're..?

00:05:22.630 --> 00:05:24.510
Gaou, what's up?

00:05:24.820 --> 00:05:26.400
Oh, you..!

00:05:26.880 --> 00:05:28.810
You were tagging along Kiki.

00:05:28.810 --> 00:05:29.680
Y-Yeah...

00:05:30.180 --> 00:05:31.680
Where is Kiki?

00:05:32.020 --> 00:05:34.190
Uhm... T-That's...

00:05:34.920 --> 00:05:37.240
Something happened, I see.

00:05:37.240 --> 00:05:38.200
Yes.

00:05:38.820 --> 00:05:41.650
He met a guy called Rei or something.

00:05:42.260 --> 00:05:43.630
He met Rei?!

00:05:43.630 --> 00:05:44.730
So he came.

00:05:51.930 --> 00:05:54.010
Y-You are..!

00:05:54.910 --> 00:05:56.080
<i>First Battle!</i>

00:05:56.530 --> 00:06:00.090
<i>Three, Two, One!</i>

00:06:00.610 --> 00:06:02.810
Go... Shoot!

00:06:03.780 --> 00:06:05.810
Go, Dragoon!

00:06:05.810 --> 00:06:09.060
Garman, blow him away like you did before!

00:06:14.310 --> 00:06:17.520
We're going in for the kill! Go, Dragoon!

00:06:29.590 --> 00:06:31.350
What's with those movements?!

00:06:31.350 --> 00:06:33.590
It looks like it's about to fall over!

00:06:39.640 --> 00:06:45.350
and yet its rotational speed hasn't gone down at all. It shows no signs of stopping!

00:06:46.450 --> 00:06:48.850
That's right. That is exactly Kiki's plan.

00:06:52.680 --> 00:06:54.180
I can't get ahold of him!

00:06:57.470 --> 00:07:02.110
<i>Why?</i> How come?! How come Takao's attacks aren't connecting?

00:07:02.110 --> 00:07:04.620
I see! It's because of these movements!

00:07:05.180 --> 00:07:10.850
Dragoon is being deceived by the unpredictable pattern of his movements!

00:07:11.330 --> 00:07:12.580
No way!

00:07:13.490 --> 00:07:14.870
This is just like...

00:07:16.600 --> 00:07:17.870
the Drunken Fist!

00:07:18.130 --> 00:07:19.370
Drunken Fist..?!

00:07:20.080 --> 00:07:23.840
At first it may look like a drunkard who can't keep a stable footing,

00:07:23.840 --> 00:07:29.910
but in reality, using unorthodox movements you confuse your opponent, dodge his attacks and strike.

00:07:29.910 --> 00:07:33.900
This is the Drunken Fist, one of China's martial art styles.

00:07:34.340 --> 00:07:36.700
Then Kiki's Beyblade is..?!

00:07:36.700 --> 00:07:41.890
That's right. Garman's movements are based on the Drunken Fist fighting style.

00:07:45.840 --> 00:07:50.280
Well? A Beyblader of your caliber can't even touch me!

00:07:50.700 --> 00:07:54.270
That may be so, but you can't win just by running around!

00:07:55.060 --> 00:07:58.790
You still don't understand the true power of Garman!

00:07:59.170 --> 00:08:00.090
What?!

00:08:05.500 --> 00:08:08.040
Kiki's Beyblade has started moving!

00:08:14.260 --> 00:08:19.410
This is my Beyblade's secret move—the Drunk Monkey Attack!

00:08:26.740 --> 00:08:29.060
A monkey Sacred Beast..?!

00:08:31.760 --> 00:08:33.830
A Sacred Beast?!

00:08:39.810 --> 00:08:41.900
<i>Unbelievable!</i>

00:08:46.370 --> 00:08:47.380
It split up!

00:08:47.960 --> 00:08:56.650
No, it didn't split up! The Beyblade's tricky high speed movements make it look like there are many of them.

00:08:56.980 --> 00:08:57.900
Still...

00:08:59.030 --> 00:09:00.650
I-If this goes on..!

00:09:03.270 --> 00:09:05.390
You can't dodge my attacks!

00:09:09.410 --> 00:09:10.850
Dragoon, move!

00:09:16.240 --> 00:09:17.160
Oh no!

00:09:25.570 --> 00:09:26.660
I win.

00:09:29.540 --> 00:09:31.230
What a fearsome attack...

00:09:38.570 --> 00:09:42.860
To think I'd run into someone else with a Sacred Beast this soon...

00:09:44.800 --> 00:09:47.490
So he's a Sacred Beast User like us...

00:09:48.160 --> 00:09:52.390
Just how many Sacred Beasts are scattered around the world, I wonder..?

00:09:52.820 --> 00:09:53.940
Besides that,

00:09:54.930 --> 00:09:57.760
what's the deal with the Byakko Clan..?

00:10:01.090 --> 00:10:05.880
Kiki and the Drunk Monkey Attack...

00:10:07.670 --> 00:10:11.000
Things are getting intersting, huh, Dragoon?

00:10:29.330 --> 00:10:31.520
You're all talk.

00:10:31.840 --> 00:10:37.470
Don't be hasty! This was just the first battle. The fight is far from over.

00:10:37.970 --> 00:10:39.940
You don't seem fazed by what happened.

00:10:39.940 --> 00:10:41.010
Of course not!

00:10:42.530 --> 00:10:45.800
I can't help but feel happy to get to fight such a strong opponent!

00:10:47.010 --> 00:10:48.040
You're bluffing.

00:10:48.480 --> 00:10:52.850
See for yourself whether I'm bluffing or not. Let's go with the Second Battle!

00:10:53.680 --> 00:10:55.180
<i>Second Battle!</i>

00:10:55.530 --> 00:10:56.420
You haven't seen the best Dragoon can do yet!

00:10:56.420 --> 00:10:59.000
Three, Two, One!

00:10:59.000 --> 00:11:01.450
You're just a sore loser. Save your breath.

00:11:01.450 --> 00:11:02.380
Three, Two, One!

00:11:02.540 --> 00:11:03.920
Go Shoot!

00:11:04.210 --> 00:11:05.980
Go, Dragoon!

00:11:06.370 --> 00:11:08.610
Finish him, Garman!

00:11:12.930 --> 00:11:17.620
What's wrong? Have you finally realized that it's useless to try and attack me?

00:11:18.490 --> 00:11:19.620
I wonder about that.

00:11:20.040 --> 00:11:21.800
Your little act ends here.

00:11:21.800 --> 00:11:22.820
Let's go!

00:11:23.220 --> 00:11:26.440
Drunk Monkey Attack!

00:11:33.300 --> 00:11:34.210
Now!

00:11:34.920 --> 00:11:38.640
Go, Dragoon! Use your Storm Attack!

00:11:43.540 --> 00:11:45.630
What is he planning to do..?

00:11:48.850 --> 00:11:49.980
This is..?!

00:11:52.340 --> 00:11:54.050
Seiryuu!

00:12:01.340 --> 00:12:04.200
Go, Dragoon!

00:12:11.200 --> 00:12:12.290
<i>Wonderful!</i>

00:12:20.960 --> 00:12:24.310
T-This can't be! M-My Garman was..!

00:12:25.380 --> 00:12:27.820
You did it! You really won, Takao!

00:12:28.130 --> 00:12:32.560
He threw all the afterimages
of Kiki's Beyblade up in the air!

00:12:33.210 --> 00:12:35.510
That was brilliant, Takao.

00:12:37.540 --> 00:12:39.130
I knew you had it in you, Takao.

00:12:39.970 --> 00:12:41.060
Not yet!

00:12:41.900 --> 00:12:46.080
The fight isn't over yet! There's
still the Final Battle! Get ready!

00:12:46.550 --> 00:12:47.330
Yeah!

00:12:54.150 --> 00:12:55.400
Kiki-sama...

00:12:55.400 --> 00:12:56.430
Bruce..!

00:12:56.980 --> 00:12:59.250
How dare you... Why are you still here?

00:12:59.610 --> 00:13:02.690
I told you to get out of my sight. What do you want?!

00:13:02.940 --> 00:13:04.010
That is...

00:13:04.010 --> 00:13:07.700
Kiki, who gave you permission to do this?

00:13:08.280 --> 00:13:08.980
Mao!

00:13:09.320 --> 00:13:11.900
Bruce! You told her what I was doing?!

00:13:11.900 --> 00:13:12.740
Yes.

00:13:12.740 --> 00:13:15.180
You bastard! After everything that happened..!

00:13:15.180 --> 00:13:19.420
Do you plan to betray the Clan's rules?! Unnecessary battles are strictly forbidden!

00:13:20.290 --> 00:13:22.690
Mao, don't get full of yourself.

00:13:22.690 --> 00:13:24.130
You break promises.

00:13:25.220 --> 00:13:26.740
Kiki, not good.

00:13:27.650 --> 00:13:28.650
Gaou...

00:13:28.930 --> 00:13:33.230
Shut up! Rei was here! I just wanted to take revenge on the traitor!

00:13:34.000 --> 00:13:36.740
And yet, you seem to be struggling here.

00:13:39.460 --> 00:13:40.130
Kiki!

00:13:40.730 --> 00:13:42.890
Holy cow, what a jump!

00:13:42.890 --> 00:13:44.700
He's like a ninja!

00:13:44.700 --> 00:13:46.160
Where are you going?!

00:13:46.160 --> 00:13:49.140
Shut up! I'll come back in time for the tournament!

00:13:49.530 --> 00:13:51.450
S-So don't try to stop me!

00:13:54.400 --> 00:13:57.640
By the way, who in the world are you guys?

00:13:58.880 --> 00:14:01.890
You aren't worthy of knowing who we are!

00:14:02.670 --> 00:14:04.000
What?!

00:14:04.000 --> 00:14:04.860
That's how it is!

00:14:05.440 --> 00:14:08.280
Why you... You cheeky catgirl!

00:14:08.280 --> 00:14:09.400
Shup up, nyaa!

00:14:09.400 --> 00:14:10.220
Mao!

00:14:10.680 --> 00:14:12.660
What are you doing here?

00:14:13.510 --> 00:14:14.320
Rei..?

00:14:15.050 --> 00:14:17.590
Why are you guys here?

00:14:18.190 --> 00:14:25.140
Same as you guys. We're participating
in the Beyblade China Tournament!

00:14:25.590 --> 00:14:28.680
No way! the Byakko Clan is entering the tournament..?!

00:14:29.080 --> 00:14:30.150
But why?!

00:14:30.480 --> 00:14:34.400
Why, you ask? To defeat you, of course! What other reason could there be?!

00:14:34.840 --> 00:14:37.590
We will defeat you and take Byakko back with us!

00:14:37.890 --> 00:14:40.150
That's our only goal!

00:14:40.660 --> 00:14:42.360
You want to... deafeat me..?

00:14:42.640 --> 00:14:46.360
We're not gonna let you do that! Rei has us...

00:14:48.180 --> 00:14:49.830
his friends!

00:14:50.590 --> 00:14:53.910
Friends, you say?! Rei, are you serious?

00:14:54.400 --> 00:14:55.060
Yeah.

00:14:57.710 --> 00:15:00.680
Have you thown away our clan's pride, Rei?

00:15:02.240 --> 00:15:03.880
You're going too far, Mao.

00:15:10.000 --> 00:15:11.310
Big Bro...

00:15:16.250 --> 00:15:18.800
It's been a long time, Rei.

00:15:19.710 --> 00:15:20.860
Rai...

00:15:21.880 --> 00:15:24.410
What happened here today is our responsibility.

00:15:26.140 --> 00:15:27.360
You have my apologies.

00:15:27.890 --> 00:15:29.120
No...

00:15:36.320 --> 00:15:40.280
They are the comrades you chose. I'm sure they are adequately strong.

00:15:40.280 --> 00:15:43.370
But in the end, all your efforts will be vain.

00:15:43.940 --> 00:15:44.900
What did you say?!

00:15:45.330 --> 00:15:48.380
He's saying that you have no chance to win.

00:15:51.440 --> 00:15:53.540
We will be the ones to win.

00:15:56.490 --> 00:15:57.480
Wait!

00:15:57.920 --> 00:16:00.790
Rai, we'll be waiting at the tournament.

00:16:01.170 --> 00:16:02.330
Wait just a second.

00:16:05.520 --> 00:16:09.200
Your name's Rai, isn't it? Fight me.

00:16:10.650 --> 00:16:11.810
Fight you..?

00:16:14.610 --> 00:16:19.580
You control a Sacred Beast as well, don't you? I want to see that power for myself.

00:16:26.550 --> 00:16:27.300
I refuse.

00:16:29.010 --> 00:16:32.260
We have a rule we abide by no matter what.

00:16:32.850 --> 00:16:34.010
A rule, you say?!

00:16:34.420 --> 00:16:35.370
Well, then.

00:16:35.370 --> 00:16:36.010
Stop!

00:16:36.700 --> 00:16:38.550
Give it up, will you?!

00:16:39.490 --> 00:16:43.520
Stop it. The one I want to fight is that guy.

00:16:51.710 --> 00:16:53.190
Where are you shooting..?!

00:17:09.070 --> 00:17:11.330
You can't fight like this.

00:17:13.130 --> 00:17:14.150
What did you..?!

00:17:15.900 --> 00:17:17.680
T-This is..!

00:17:25.350 --> 00:17:29.220
How can a Beyblade do this kind of damage..?!

00:17:29.220 --> 00:17:31.630
<i>Unbelievable!</i>

00:17:32.240 --> 00:17:33.750
Wow!

00:17:35.300 --> 00:17:36.370
You..!

00:17:37.600 --> 00:17:42.740
Someone who would get shocked by <i>just this</i> was going to fight against my brother?

00:17:43.360 --> 00:17:44.610
How dare you?!

00:17:45.170 --> 00:17:48.800
My big brother is <i>way</i> stronger than me, you know?

00:17:48.800 --> 00:17:49.600
Mao!

00:17:50.780 --> 00:17:54.000
Don't talk too much. Let's go.

00:17:55.720 --> 00:17:56.970
Coming!

00:18:01.850 --> 00:18:05.690
Traitor! I will never <i>ever</i> forgive you!

00:18:13.250 --> 00:18:17.170
They came here... to defeat me?!

00:18:58.240 --> 00:18:59.940
Say, Rei...

00:19:00.660 --> 00:19:03.450
Why were they calling you a traitor?

00:19:05.750 --> 00:19:06.880
That's...

00:19:08.780 --> 00:19:11.200
Why did you get silent all of a sudden?

00:19:12.390 --> 00:19:14.720
It's probably something he can't talk about.

00:19:16.800 --> 00:19:21.690
You don't have to force yourself to speak. I didn't really care to know anyway.

00:19:22.230 --> 00:19:23.740
Hey, Kai!

00:19:24.370 --> 00:19:26.360
He's always so heartless...

00:19:26.360 --> 00:19:32.680
He must be quite shocked. In just one day, he met one strong Beyblader after the other.

00:19:32.680 --> 00:19:37.300
Will the China Tournament be full of Beybladers as strong as them?

00:19:39.060 --> 00:19:40.750
This is so exciting!

00:19:41.060 --> 00:19:42.700
Takao!

00:19:42.700 --> 00:19:44.740
This is nothing to be happy about!

00:19:45.200 --> 00:19:50.760
Yeah but after meeting such strong Beybladers, it's normal to get fired up!

00:19:50.760 --> 00:19:52.620
Well, I guess.

00:19:52.620 --> 00:19:54.130
Oh, Takao...

00:19:54.130 --> 00:19:55.690
See? I'm right, am I not?

00:19:55.690 --> 00:19:57.010
Yeah, yeah, sure.

00:19:57.010 --> 00:19:58.770
I agree with Takao.

00:20:05.080 --> 00:20:08.250
Takao, you're really one pleasant fellow.

00:20:08.250 --> 00:20:11.570
I realized I'm worrying over nothing.

00:20:11.570 --> 00:20:15.840
That's right. Worrying about it won't change a thing! Let's just take it easy.

00:20:20.560 --> 00:20:24.530
Takao, <i>very good.</i> You managed to cheer Rei up.

00:20:24.530 --> 00:20:29.200
I'm sure he didn't do it consciously, but I guess it's the result that counts.

00:20:34.810 --> 00:20:37.720
H-Hey, Kai! Wait for us!

00:20:59.130 --> 00:21:01.140
China Tournament, here we come!

00:21:06.900 --> 00:21:09.700
We're coming for you, Rai!

00:21:39.960 --> 00:21:44.720
Spring waves its hand smiling,

00:21:44.720 --> 00:21:50.200
Summer spreads passion.

00:21:50.200 --> 00:21:55.350
Seasons pass one after the other,

00:21:55.350 --> 00:21:59.560
Fall and Winter are good friends.

00:22:01.000 --> 00:22:05.660
When there is a problem you can't solve,

00:22:05.660 --> 00:22:11.560
Trust, friendship, love and emotion

00:22:14.120 --> 00:22:18.800
Clouds keep flying across the sky,

00:22:18.800 --> 00:22:24.200
the sky keeps changing every second

00:22:24.200 --> 00:22:29.090
My eyes well up and tears stream down my face,

00:22:29.090 --> 00:22:33.090
but they're not tears of sadness

00:22:34.820 --> 00:22:39.420
I summon my courage and try to put it into words.

00:22:39.420 --> 00:22:44.770
"Let's go on a journey to the city of hope!"

